  "description": "Introducing the Eskute T300 Max Folding Electric Trike – a revolutionary blend of safety, comfort, and convenience, designed especially for seniors and first-time riders.\n\nUpgraded with an intelligent one-touch reversing system, the T300 Max puts effortless control at your fingertips. Simply press the reverse button on the handlebar to move backward smoothly – no pushing, no pulling, and no need to get off. Whether you're in a tight alley, a crowded parking lot, or your own driveway, seamless switching between forward and reverse makes maneuvering with heavy loads easier than ever.\n\nEngineered with a stable 3-wheel design and a low-step frame, the T300 Max offers superior stability and easy access for riders of all heights (fits 4'8\" – 6'2\"). Its extra-wide plush seat with an adjustable backrest provides ergonomic support, relieving pressure on hips and lower back for all-day riding comfort.\n\nPowered by a removable 48V 20Ah TÜV-certified battery, the T300 Max delivers an impressive 45–80 miles on a single charge, so you can run errands, visit friends, or enjoy long countryside rides without range anxiety. The peak 1200W brushless motor effortlessly handles hills and heavy loads, with a top speed of 18+ mph for smooth, confident riding.\n\nThe compact folding design allows for easy storage in car trunks, elevators, or tight spaces – folding down to just 36.2\" L × 35.4\" W × 39.7\" H and unfolding to a stable 61.1\" L × 36.2\" W × 38.5\" H. With a 400 lbs payload capacity, a spacious front basket, and a versatile rear rack (top: 18.5\" × 13.8\" × 8.3\" H), it adapts to everything from grocery runs to pet-friendly adventures.\n\nRide with confidence. Ride with Eskute T300 Max.",
